{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863524902896402442","content":"A Journal entry sits out *Captain's Log Day 8. This pain is unlike anything I have ever felt before. I feel like I have been shot in the heart. I pray to Athena for guidance but I cannot hear her. The pain, it blocks it, I hope I could cure myself of it, but I feel no relief in prayer. It seems only yesterday I was filled with so much hope, but now I find she has left Pandora's box. I had saved people from the prison, I had lit the lamps of the streets, and now I find myself in despair, far greater than I could have ever imagined. Oh sweet Secel I am sorry, I never intended for this to happen. I never knew what love was truly like. Oh Secel, I am but a great fool. I have found myself torn between you and my Goddess. And you have been the one to suffer. If I could take it all back I would, if the Fates would let me change course I would have stayed in Liverpool, so that neither of us would experience such pain. I can hardly continue forward, but I must go on. Secel, I can't ask you to forgive me, only blame*","created_at":"2021-07-19T12:01:00.370000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"866650833792794634","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
