{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"BenevolentDM","id":"470420431841656833","is_bot":0,"username":"benevolentdm"},"author_id":"470420431841656833","channel_id":"863524902896402442","content":"*Leafing through the rather mundane pile of documents you don't find much of interest, official letters from past colleagues, Invitations to events long past, and a handful of birth records likely copied from the Library at some point. Perhaps you can look through again later for anything you may have missed... The Journal is another matter, and you may feel a bit of apprehension looking through your mother's private thoughts, mostly about important events taking place in her life and people she'd met, your name is mentioned increasingly in the second half, usually accompanied by notes of endearment. The Locket... you open it expecting to see a portrait of a dear relative, or perhaps an old flame from your mother's past, but instead you discover a portrait of a handsome Orcish gentleman, the Locket itself seems special as well, but you can't quite put your finger on whether it possesses some innate magic or merely a sense of mystery.*","created_at":"2021-07-21T00:54:58.840000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867207998720049182","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"StarPilot94","id":"468162764586876949","is_bot":0,"username":"starpilot94"},"author_id":"468162764586876949","channel_id":"863524902896402442","content":"Secel simply cuddles up next to Johnathan and closes her eyes.","created_at":"2021-07-21T06:51:30.219000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867297720666161213","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Gor-eal","id":"859432639681134592","is_bot":0,"username":"gorealthundhal"},"author_id":"859432639681134592","channel_id":"863524902896402442","content":"*Captain's Log, day 10. I have never been happier in my life. Athena has given her blessings for me to be with Secel. I have never had feelings for another person like this in my life. I have grown to feel as though she is one of the reasons as to why I am here. My Godmother's possessions have also come into my care as well, in it I have found a picture of my father. I hardly remember him but there he is, unmistakably him. There seem to be a plethora of documents as well as her journal. I fear I have been neglecting Secel while I examine these though. These feelings and relationship are far new to me and I have no way of knowing how to act around her. Before it was easy but now things are different, my heart hasn't pounded this much outside of combat, yet I welcome it as it feels scary yet pleasant. I have enlisted my goblin to help me examine these but I haven't the faintest idea how helpful he really is. He is still terrified of me and exiting the ship, although his chess is improving.*","created_at":"2021-07-21T07:11:34.179000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"867302770440798228","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
